@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "toolChoice: 'required',",
+  "cause": "refundAgent sets toolChoice: 'required', which makes Gemini force a function call on every turn, so after approveRefund is declined the agent can only keep calling tools (re-asking approval, looking up the order) until maxTurns is exhausted and it never produces the customer reply.",
+  "evidence": "Reproduced by sending the refund request, resuming the approveRefund interrupt with approved: false, and repeating: before the fix the agent re-raised approveRefund on every step with empty final text; after changing the line to toolChoice: 'auto' it ends with 'Your refund for order A-1001 was not approved because there is a duplicate claim.' and no further interrupts. The Google plugin maps 'required' to FunctionCallingMode.ANY (node_modules/@genkit-ai/google-genai/lib/common/converters.js:298)."
+}
